2.4 Constraints
Technical: The proposal mandates Node.js + MySQL as the canonical stack; design decisions must honor this.
Budgetary: As an academic project, the design favors managed free-tier services (Heroku, Railway, Vercel, PlanetScale free tiers) over enterprise-grade options.
Regulatory: Although not subject to FERPA/GDPR at the academic-prototype stage, the design adopts privacy-by-design principles to ease future compliance.
Temporal: Single-semester delivery window — design must be implementable by a small team (1–4 developers) in ~12–16 weeks.

