3.2 Design Constraints
Stateless Application Tier — to permit horizontal scaling per NFR-10, application servers must hold no session-affine state; sessions live in Redis or as signed JWTs.
Single Source of Truth for Chat Data — MySQL is the authoritative store; Redis is treated as a volatile cache.
No Storage of Raw OpenAI API Keys in Source — must use environment variables or a secrets manager (NFR-04).
Schema-Forward Database Design — every migration is versioned (Flyway/Knex.js migrations) to support reliable deployment.
