Search algorithm (FR-16): Uses MySQL MATCH ... AGAINST natural-language mode on the full-text index. Snippet highlighting is performed application-side using a regex over matched tokens.
SELECT c.id, c.title, c.updated_at,
       MATCH(m.content) AGAINST(? IN NATURAL LANGUAGE MODE) AS relevance
FROM conversations c
JOIN messages m ON m.conversation_id = c.id
WHERE c.user_id = ?
  AND MATCH(m.content) AGAINST(? IN NATURAL LANGUAGE MODE)
GROUP BY c.id
ORDER BY relevance DESC, c.updated_at DESC
LIMIT 20;

