PII Sanitization Patterns (FR-18):
const PII_PATTERNS = [
  { name: 'email',       regex: /\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\b/g, replacement: '[EMAIL]' },
  { name: 'phone_intl',  regex: /\+?\d{1,3}[\s-]?\(?\d{1,4}\)?[\s-]?\d{3,4}[\s-]?\d{3,4}/g, replacement: '[PHONE]' },
  { name: 'ssn_us',      regex: /\b\d{3}-\d{2}-\d{4}\b/g, replacement: '[SSN]' },
  { name: 'credit_card', regex: /\b(?:\d[ -]*?){13,19}\b/g, replacement: '[CARD]' }, // followed by Luhn check
  { name: 'ip',          regex: /\b(?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}\b/g, replacement: '[IP]' },
];

Retry Policy (FR-20): Exponential backoff with jitter — delay = min(2^attempt × 500ms + random(0..500ms), 8000ms), max 3 retries. Only retries on HTTP 429, 500, 502, 503, 504.
