8.6 Compliance
While the v1.0 prototype is not under GDPR/FERPA contractual obligation, the design adopts the following privacy-by-design principles, anticipating future compliance:
Right to Erasure: DELETE /me cascades to remove all user data within 30 days.
Data Minimization: PII scrubber (FR-18) prevents accidental PII transmission to the third-party LLM.
Purpose Limitation: Email addresses used only for transactional notifications; no marketing.
Disclosure: A privacy policy page enumerates all data flows (especially OpenAI as a sub-processor).

